WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
"Echo Of A Letter" (Episode 13)

3
00:12.023 --> 00:16.510
[Longevity, a character often seen at birthday parties]

4
00:17.760 --> 00:19.280
Congratulations, Master Chen.

5
00:20.600 --> 00:21.799
You're looking so spirited.

6
00:21.879 --> 00:22.879
Tell me about it.

7
00:22.920 --> 00:25.159
Rongxin's stock has been rising lately.

8
00:25.239 --> 00:26.839
Isn't that only natural?

9
00:27.359 --> 00:27.680
Thank you.

10
00:27.760 --> 00:28.760
Good, good.

11
00:29.359 --> 00:30.119
Fourth Young Master.

12
00:30.199 --> 00:31.655
Next time you need anything, just say the word.

13
00:31.679 --> 00:32.679
Sure, no problem.

14
00:33.799 --> 00:35.479
Let's look out for each other from now on.

15
00:38.920 --> 00:39.440
Let me take this call first.

16
00:39.520 --> 00:40.039
Please excuse me.

17
00:40.119 --> 00:41.279
Go right ahead.

18
00:41.358 --> 00:44.038
This is Young Mr. Chen's first appearance at a formal family event.

19
00:44.209 --> 00:45.056
[Zhao Shengge]

20
00:45.152 --> 00:47.632
He used to be an illegitimate child, and now he's the Fourth Young Master.

21
00:52.320 --> 00:53.520
Chen Wan!

22
00:53.600 --> 00:54.679
You played me!

23
00:54.759 --> 00:55.480
Waiter.

24
00:55.560 --> 00:57.959
Bring me a copy of today's Harbor Evening News.

25
00:58.039 --> 00:59.455
You tricked me into buying up retail shares.

26
00:59.479 --> 01:00.816
Then you bought the dip when the price fell,

27
01:00.840 --> 01:02.296
teaming up with the market makers to rig the market.

28
01:02.320 --> 01:03.360
Are you trying to ruin me?

29
01:04.000 --> 01:06.400
Then I hope you plug this financial hole soon, Mr. Liao,

30
01:06.480 --> 01:07.680
and save White Crane Hall.

31
01:10.040 --> 01:11.439
Believe me,

32
01:11.492 --> 01:12.709
I'll leak those photos of yours—

33
01:12.760 --> 01:13.320
Go ahead.

34
01:13.400 --> 01:15.040
Though before you do,

35
01:15.120 --> 01:16.959
I suggest you read today's Harbor Evening News.

36
01:16.983 --> 01:18.157
[Taiji's new opening brings the rich Haishi families out]

37
01:18.519 --> 01:21.480
My mother and Meng Yuanxiong of Taiji were business partners.

38
01:21.560 --> 01:22.880
They started a business together.

39
01:24.519 --> 01:25.639
You played me!

40
01:25.719 --> 01:27.560
Back up your claims with evidence.

41
01:27.640 --> 01:28.999
Maliciously inducing trades,

42
01:29.079 --> 01:30.399
leaking confidential information,

43
01:30.439 --> 01:31.616
manipulating the stock market—

44
01:31.640 --> 01:33.415
any one of those will land you in deep trouble.

45
01:33.439 --> 01:35.656
Just wait for the Securities Commission to penalize you!

46
01:35.680 --> 01:36.960
Don't trouble yourself.

47
01:37.040 --> 01:39.040
I've already received their warning.

48
01:47.159 --> 01:48.959
Go have a drink with your father in a bit.

49
01:49.560 --> 01:50.560
No need.

50
01:51.439 --> 01:52.320
Come on.

51
01:52.400 --> 01:53.480
It's his birthday.

52
01:53.560 --> 01:54.799
Hurry and go toast him.

53
01:54.879 --> 01:55.359
Hurry.

54
01:55.439 --> 01:56.439
Fine.

55
02:01.280 --> 02:03.320
Tonight's guest is very important. Fill your glass.

56
02:04.480 --> 02:06.040
It's time you helped the family.

57
02:06.560 --> 02:08.839
Once we secure that tobacco shipping route of his,

58
02:08.919 --> 02:11.000
the Chen family's power will expand considerably.

59
02:11.080 --> 02:12.800
Has Rongxin really fallen this far?

60
02:13.960 --> 02:15.760
Even if you make me sell myself,

61
02:15.840 --> 02:18.239
I'm afraid it still won't bring it back from the dead.

62
02:18.319 --> 02:20.519
It's just a toast, basic social courtesy.

63
02:20.599 --> 02:22.000
What nonsense are you spouting?

64
02:22.879 --> 02:23.519
Hey.

65
02:23.599 --> 02:24.840
Old Chen,

66
02:28.159 --> 02:30.600
why the grim face?

67
02:30.680 --> 02:31.519
It's nothing.

68
02:31.599 --> 02:32.320
All right, all right.

69
02:32.400 --> 02:33.040
Don't get upset.

70
02:33.120 --> 02:34.120
Careful.

71
02:34.919 --> 02:35.959
Where's my fine liquor?

72
02:36.039 --> 02:37.399
Top me up.

73
02:37.479 --> 02:39.360
I keep it on hand for you at all times.

74
02:39.960 --> 02:43.280
Rongbaozhai's Da Fugui has a rich, savory aroma.

75
02:43.879 --> 02:44.960
Here, Uncle Xu.

76
02:45.639 --> 02:46.480
Cheers.

77
02:46.560 --> 02:47.799
Wan.

78
02:47.879 --> 02:49.679
Have a drink with Uncle Xu.

79
02:49.759 --> 02:50.760
From now on,

80
02:50.840 --> 02:52.119
for Rongxin Tobacco,

81
02:52.199 --> 02:54.000
I'll have your back.

82
02:54.080 --> 02:58.000
Stick with the right person and you won't stumble.

83
02:58.080 --> 02:58.760
Yes, indeed.

84
02:58.840 --> 03:02.320
We won't trouble you with the tobacco business, Boss Xu.

85
03:02.400 --> 03:04.160
Rongxin has other plans.

86
03:04.240 --> 03:05.680
What nonsense are you talking about?

87
03:06.560 --> 03:07.440
Wan.

88
03:07.520 --> 03:09.359
Today is your father's birthday.

89
03:09.439 --> 03:10.839
It's just a toast.

90
03:10.919 --> 03:12.880
Back when your mother was young,

91
03:12.960 --> 03:14.960
she had to toast Uncle Xu too.

92
03:15.680 --> 03:16.680
Did you know that?

93
03:16.759 --> 03:19.520
And back then, it wasn't as simple as just drinking.

94
03:20.240 --> 03:22.639
Wan, you're a sensible kid.

95
03:22.719 --> 03:24.200
Don't be picky.

96
03:24.280 --> 03:25.855
What difference does it make who you're with?

97
03:25.879 --> 03:29.359
No need for such suggestive remarks, First Madam.

98
03:29.439 --> 03:31.639
None of those things were my mother's choice.

99
03:31.719 --> 03:34.000
Your husband forced her to do them.

100
03:36.039 --> 03:38.920
If my mother hadn't put on a smile to entertain guests all those years,

101
03:39.000 --> 03:40.520
would he be worth what he is today?

102
03:41.400 --> 03:42.160
Second Madam,

103
03:42.240 --> 03:44.599
he used to trade away his women, and now his children.

104
03:45.120 --> 03:48.200
Chen Baoyi just turned sixteen this year.

105
03:48.280 --> 03:49.160
You'd better watch out.

106
03:49.240 --> 03:50.440
You—.

107
03:50.520 --> 03:51.656
What nonsense are you spouting?

108
03:51.680 --> 03:52.680
You insolent brat!

109
04:49.399 --> 04:50.520
You left this in my office.

110
04:50.600 --> 04:52.640
I called you earlier, you probably didn't hear it.

111
04:52.720 --> 04:53.720
Thank you.

112
04:55.279 --> 04:56.279
Mr. Zhao.

113
04:57.120 --> 04:58.680
What brings you here?

114
04:59.199 --> 05:01.199
I assumed having an invitation meant I could come.

115
05:01.480 --> 05:02.480
Yes, yes, of course.

116
05:03.800 --> 05:06.759
Your presence graces Rongxin Manor, Mr. Zhao.

117
05:07.319 --> 05:08.879
We couldn't be more delighted.

118
05:08.959 --> 05:10.216
If our hospitality falls short in any way,

119
05:10.240 --> 05:11.520
please don't hold it against us.

120
05:12.639 --> 05:13.639
Is this drink yours?

121
05:16.360 --> 05:17.360
No.

122
05:21.120 --> 05:21.600
Mr. Zhao,

123
05:21.680 --> 05:23.640
this drink was my toast to Young Master Chen.

124
05:23.720 --> 05:24.720
Then drink it yourself.

125
05:29.439 --> 05:30.439
Okay.

126
05:42.240 --> 05:43.240
Keep drinking.

127
05:58.360 --> 05:59.399
Have another.

128
06:04.160 --> 06:05.360
Pour him another glass.

129
06:09.519 --> 06:10.519
Keep going.

130
06:26.079 --> 06:27.079
Want to head back?

131
06:28.839 --> 06:30.719
Or do you want to stay and have a bit more fun?

132
06:31.720 --> 06:32.760
Let's go. Let's head back.

133
06:39.959 --> 06:40.959
Wan, you—

134
06:44.600 --> 06:45.759
Mr. Chen.

135
06:45.839 --> 06:47.896
Minglong's project is about to hold its public launch.

136
06:47.920 --> 06:49.119
As Minglong's

137
06:49.199 --> 06:51.319
personally invited technical consultant and director,

138
06:52.000 --> 06:53.480
Chen Wan's schedule will be packed.

139
06:54.079 --> 06:56.960
Without my personal permission and approval,

140
06:57.040 --> 06:58.600
he won't have the time.

141
06:59.680 --> 07:00.680
If you want Chen Wan,

142
07:01.519 --> 07:02.519
come to me first.

143
07:15.319 --> 07:16.640
Master!

144
07:16.720 --> 07:17.720
Dad!

145
07:39.040 --> 07:40.040
Zhao Shengge.

146
07:41.439 --> 07:42.560
It's going to rain.

147
07:46.639 --> 07:47.639
Zhao Shengge,

148
07:49.680 --> 07:50.999
are you

149
07:51.079 --> 07:52.240
mad at me?

150
07:55.560 --> 07:58.160
When did you start planning all of this?

151
07:58.680 --> 08:00.079
In such a short span of time,

152
08:00.680 --> 08:01.960
every single piece

153
08:02.040 --> 08:03.600
fell seamlessly into place.

154
08:03.680 --> 08:05.480
Handled with breathtaking precision.

155
08:06.079 --> 08:07.240
Truly brilliant.

156
08:10.839 --> 08:11.839
Ever since Liao Quan

157
08:12.639 --> 08:15.040
used my mother to threaten me.

158
08:16.519 --> 08:17.519
Chen Wan.

159
08:20.040 --> 08:22.319
You built Kexiang from the ground up.

160
08:23.879 --> 08:24.879
Was it hard work?

161
08:25.920 --> 08:26.640
What?

162
08:26.720 --> 08:28.079
Building Kexiang?

163
08:30.920 --> 08:32.240
Of course it was.

164
08:32.320 --> 08:34.200
Then why did you withdraw from the partnership?

165
08:37.000 --> 08:38.760
I only withdrew as a partner,

166
08:38.840 --> 08:41.599
but I'll keep following through on upcoming projects.

167
08:41.679 --> 08:43.759
Besides, I was a silent partner anyway,

168
08:45.440 --> 08:46.855
so it doesn't really make much difference.

169
08:46.879 --> 08:47.879
Is it because of me?

170
08:49.159 --> 08:50.159
No.

171
08:52.559 --> 08:53.639
Not entirely.

172
08:58.200 --> 08:59.200
Withdrawing from Kexiang

173
08:59.960 --> 09:01.719
means whatever happens down the line,

174
09:01.799 --> 09:03.120
it won't affect Minglong.

175
09:03.639 --> 09:05.720
Because Minglong signed with Kexiang,

176
09:06.320 --> 09:07.320
not Chen Wan.

177
09:08.919 --> 09:11.120
Quite the clever calculation on your part, though.

178
09:11.759 --> 09:13.720
You, Chen Wan, can walk away anytime.

179
09:16.320 --> 09:17.320
I'm sorry.

180
09:17.840 --> 09:18.840
I'm sorry.

181
09:19.840 --> 09:20.840
Sorry for what?

182
09:22.039 --> 09:23.840
For causing trouble for you and Minglong.

183
09:24.559 --> 09:24.920
Haven't you

184
09:25.000 --> 09:26.799
already eliminated all that trouble?

185
09:27.759 --> 09:29.960
Minglong hasn't been affected at all so far.

186
09:31.080 --> 09:33.559
The crisis over the photos and scandals is resolved.

187
09:34.159 --> 09:36.600
White Crane Hall will never make a comeback.

188
09:37.480 --> 09:40.120
Rongxin is marching step by step toward its ruin.

189
09:40.679 --> 09:43.015
And the Securities Commission probably can't touch you either.

190
09:43.039 --> 09:44.039
Chen Wan,

191
09:44.759 --> 09:46.200
what else aren't you satisfied with?

192
09:49.320 --> 09:50.679
I'm still a liability.

193
09:53.799 --> 09:55.559
How much further do you intend to take this?

194
10:00.480 --> 10:02.600
As far as I possibly can.

195
10:06.639 --> 10:07.639
Chen Wan.

196
10:08.759 --> 10:10.559
Do you remember what I told you?

197
10:15.279 --> 10:17.519
I told you to stop treating me like an ornament.

198
10:22.440 --> 10:23.440
I'm sorry.

199
10:39.519 --> 10:40.519
Chen Wan,

200
10:43.159 --> 10:45.080
do you really want to be with me?

201
10:50.759 --> 10:52.240
I don't think you do.

202
10:54.679 --> 10:55.919
Not in the way I understand it—

203
10:55.960 --> 10:57.000
being together openly,

204
10:57.600 --> 10:58.679
for the long haul,

205
10:59.240 --> 11:01.240
and with complete honesty.

206
11:01.320 --> 11:02.040
No.

207
11:02.120 --> 11:03.600
That's not true, Zhao Shengge.

208
11:04.799 --> 11:06.199
I really do like you.

209
11:06.279 --> 11:08.120
I really want to be with you.

210
11:08.200 --> 11:09.839
With a clean slate and nothing to hide.

211
11:09.919 --> 11:11.679
I don't want that kind of relationship.

212
11:12.960 --> 11:14.039
I don't like it.

213
11:20.519 --> 11:21.519
Zhao Shengge...

214
11:22.759 --> 11:24.919
Can I still pursue you, then?

215
11:25.960 --> 11:26.960
Chen Wan,

216
11:28.919 --> 11:30.279
you're very smart.

217
11:31.519 --> 11:32.559
When you pursue me,

218
11:32.639 --> 11:35.000
you observe what I like to eat,

219
11:35.879 --> 11:37.400
what I like to drink,

220
11:37.480 --> 11:39.279
and what I want to do at any given time.

221
11:40.840 --> 11:43.159
But what if I hide myself away?

222
11:45.080 --> 11:47.959
From that point on, you wouldn't know my mood,

223
11:48.039 --> 11:49.040
my habits,

224
11:49.120 --> 11:50.320
or my thoughts.

225
11:51.200 --> 11:52.319
Chen Wan,

226
11:52.399 --> 11:53.600
do you want to try that?

227
11:55.840 --> 11:58.080
I think I'm probably even better at hiding than you are.

228
12:00.399 --> 12:01.600
Don't be sad,

229
12:04.279 --> 12:05.879
because that's exactly how you treat me.

230
12:13.840 --> 12:15.639
You put up a Christmas tree for me.

231
12:17.480 --> 12:19.080
Caught fireflies for me.

232
12:21.159 --> 12:23.319
Sent me peonies and hydrangeas.

233
12:23.399 --> 12:24.855
You said you hoped I'd always be happy.

234
12:24.879 --> 12:26.159
Let me tell you, Chen Wan.

235
12:27.759 --> 12:28.799
Lately,

236
12:32.559 --> 12:34.080
I haven't felt very happy.

237
12:35.440 --> 12:37.279
Today is my saddest day.

238
12:44.159 --> 12:45.159
Growing up,

239
12:47.519 --> 12:49.199
I felt it was hard for me to get

240
12:49.279 --> 12:51.840
the kind of effortless joy others had.

241
12:53.720 --> 12:54.960
When I got a little older,

242
12:55.759 --> 12:57.519
I realized even being loved was hard.

243
12:59.600 --> 13:00.600
And now?

244
13:04.200 --> 13:05.879
I don't even have a shred of trust.

245
13:09.360 --> 13:10.360
Zhao Shengge...

246
13:11.279 --> 13:13.320
Can I still pursue you?

247
13:17.120 --> 13:18.120
Better forget it.

248
13:27.240 --> 13:28.240
Zhao Shengge,

249
13:29.039 --> 13:30.440
may I pursue you?

250
13:59.080 --> 14:00.080
Chen Wan.

251
14:01.240 --> 14:03.360
If you don't know how to pursue someone, stop trying.

252
14:03.799 --> 14:04.799
Zhao Shengge...

253
14:08.879 --> 14:09.879
Let me do it.

254
14:14.759 --> 14:16.639
You really have no clue how to pursue someone.

255
14:17.559 --> 14:19.479
No matter how much I teach you, you never learn.

256
14:20.240 --> 14:21.279
So let me take over.

257
14:29.639 --> 14:30.639
Coming over?

258
14:39.840 --> 14:41.159
Did I say you could hug me?

259
14:43.559 --> 14:44.799
Zhao Shengge,

260
14:44.879 --> 14:46.399
may I hug you?

261
14:57.799 --> 14:58.799
Chen Wan.

262
14:59.600 --> 15:00.920
I won't ask to break up with you.

263
15:01.679 --> 15:04.399
But I'll treat you the exact way you treat me.

264
15:05.559 --> 15:07.000
Keep one thing from me,

265
15:07.080 --> 15:08.320
and I'll keep ten from you.

266
15:09.039 --> 15:09.839
Keep ten things from me,

267
15:09.919 --> 15:11.239
and I'll keep a hundred from you.

268
15:11.799 --> 15:13.839
Eventually, all those secrets will push us apart,

269
15:13.919 --> 15:15.120
and in the end, we'll be done.

270
15:16.679 --> 15:17.679
Chen Wan,

271
15:18.600 --> 15:19.919
do you want us to end?

272
15:29.080 --> 15:30.399
You messed up this badly,

273
15:30.919 --> 15:31.959
and you're the one crying?

274
15:35.360 --> 15:36.599
If I pursue you,

275
15:36.679 --> 15:38.080
I'm doing it my way.

276
15:38.720 --> 15:39.720
Do you promise?

277
15:41.879 --> 15:42.880
When I pursue someone,

278
15:42.960 --> 15:44.800
I don't sneak around in a secret relationship.

279
15:44.840 --> 15:45.840
Do you accept that?

280
15:47.759 --> 15:48.759
When I pursue someone,

281
15:50.480 --> 15:51.839
there's none of that martyrdom

282
15:51.919 --> 15:53.200
or self-sacrifice nonsense.

283
15:53.840 --> 15:54.880
Shared benefits,

284
15:54.960 --> 15:56.120
equal risks.

285
15:56.200 --> 15:57.200
Do you agree?

286
15:58.399 --> 15:59.040
Zhao Shengge,

287
15:59.120 --> 16:00.120
I agree to all of it.

288
16:02.039 --> 16:03.039
Chen Wan,

289
16:04.360 --> 16:06.160
you're a repeat offender with me.

290
16:06.240 --> 16:07.599
Taking advantage of my feelings.

291
16:07.679 --> 16:08.439
I really can't

292
16:08.519 --> 16:09.679
trust you so easily anymore.

293
16:12.639 --> 16:13.639
Swear it.

294
16:16.879 --> 16:18.280
If Chen Wan does it again,

295
16:18.360 --> 16:20.879
Zhao Shengge will never be happy or get his wish again.

296
16:22.120 --> 16:22.839
No.

297
16:22.919 --> 16:23.919
Don't.

298
16:25.120 --> 16:26.280
The heavens already heard it.

299
16:26.799 --> 16:27.919
You've already made the vow.

300
16:41.080 --> 16:42.080
Chen Wan,

301
16:43.559 --> 16:46.120
do this again, and I really will lock you up.

302
16:51.720 --> 16:52.720
Zhao Shengge,

303
16:53.480 --> 16:55.439
do you really like me that much?

304
16:55.519 --> 16:57.240
You can take it as

305
16:58.360 --> 16:59.360
love.

306
17:00.600 --> 17:02.360
Take it as I love you,

307
17:02.440 --> 17:03.440
Chen Wan.

308
17:08.960 --> 17:09.960
Otherwise, how could I

309
17:10.000 --> 17:12.079
let the same person fool me so many times in a row?

310
17:14.680 --> 17:15.920
Zhao Shengge,

311
17:16.000 --> 17:17.319
I loved you first.

312
17:18.279 --> 17:19.479
I love you the most.

313
17:19.559 --> 17:20.640
I know.

314
17:20.720 --> 17:22.039
I believe you have more right

315
17:22.119 --> 17:23.840
than anyone in the world to say that.

316
17:23.920 --> 17:25.120
You don't know.

317
17:25.200 --> 17:25.920
Okay.

318
17:26.000 --> 17:27.160
I don't know, so tell me.

319
17:27.240 --> 17:28.640
Tell me about it, okay?

320
17:35.400 --> 17:36.440
My Chen Wan

321
17:37.880 --> 17:39.400
really is a big crybaby.

322
17:40.599 --> 17:42.359
Zhao Shengge, I'm sorry.

323
17:47.880 --> 17:48.880
What's wrong?

324
17:50.200 --> 17:51.440
Why are you apologizing again?

325
17:54.160 --> 17:55.199
I'm sorry.

326
17:55.279 --> 17:56.279
I'm sick.

327
17:58.839 --> 18:01.119
Are you apologizing just for taking medicine?

328
18:05.839 --> 18:06.839
Here.

329
18:07.440 --> 18:08.959
Everyone gets sick,

330
18:09.039 --> 18:10.039
right?

331
18:13.200 --> 18:14.400
Thank you.

332
18:14.480 --> 18:15.480
Thank you.

333
18:17.720 --> 18:19.480
All right, stop crying.

334
18:21.359 --> 18:22.799
There, there. Be good.

335
18:32.279 --> 18:33.279
Chen Wan,

336
18:33.839 --> 18:34.839
look.

337
18:36.440 --> 18:37.679
Do you think that bird

338
18:37.759 --> 18:39.319
saw you crying just now?

339
18:39.960 --> 18:41.360
Better not let it see.

340
18:41.440 --> 18:42.440
Thirty years old

341
18:42.480 --> 18:43.360
and still shedding tears.

342
18:43.440 --> 18:45.680
There's no rule saying you can't cry at thirty.

343
18:46.759 --> 18:48.199
As far as I'm concerned,

344
18:48.279 --> 18:49.799
you can cry even when you're sixty.

345
18:55.000 --> 18:56.000
Chen Wan,

346
18:57.039 --> 18:58.719
back during your days at the Chen house...

347
19:02.519 --> 19:04.239
The Chen family had a kennel

348
19:04.319 --> 19:05.800
with three Siberian Huskies

349
19:05.880 --> 19:07.119
and a Bernese Mountain Dog.

350
19:07.960 --> 19:09.640
I lived in there for a year and a half.

351
19:11.359 --> 19:13.039
Right before I went to Xiaolanshan.

352
19:15.319 --> 19:16.319
Zhao Shengge,

353
19:18.079 --> 19:20.119
do you pity me a little right now?

354
19:22.319 --> 19:23.720
I don't pity you.

355
19:25.079 --> 19:26.640
If I had to put a word to it,

356
19:27.480 --> 19:29.720
I hope you'll understand it as tenderness,

357
19:30.400 --> 19:31.400
and cherishing you.

358
19:37.279 --> 19:38.759
You don't need to pity me, though.

359
19:40.000 --> 19:42.000
Because I gave them plenty of trouble.

360
19:43.640 --> 19:44.959
By the end,

361
19:45.039 --> 19:47.680
it was hard to tell who tormented whom more.

362
19:48.960 --> 19:50.480
Besides, it was back then

363
19:51.039 --> 19:52.399
that I met you for the first time.

364
19:52.880 --> 19:54.279
Though you probably forgot.

365
19:57.119 --> 19:58.119
When was that?

366
20:00.440 --> 20:02.319
It was my third year after being sent in.

367
20:03.000 --> 20:04.920
Liao Quan still wouldn't let me go in the end,

368
20:05.519 --> 20:07.320
so I escaped.

369
20:07.400 --> 20:09.079
They sent a lot of people after me.

370
20:13.799 --> 20:15.439
I had a fever at the time,

371
20:15.519 --> 20:16.800
completely delirious from it.

372
20:16.880 --> 20:18.440
All I knew was to keep walking forward,

373
20:18.920 --> 20:21.440
until I reached the orphanage next to the psychiatric hospital.

374
20:22.039 --> 20:25.039
That day, you happened to be at the Xiaolanshan Phase Two orphanage

375
20:25.119 --> 20:26.279
attending a charity event.

376
20:26.359 --> 20:27.719
I ran into you.

377
20:27.799 --> 20:29.919
You thought I was one of the kids from the orphanage.

378
20:30.119 --> 20:32.200
Running around blindly, I stumbled into your lounge

379
20:34.920 --> 20:35.719
because through the window,

380
20:35.799 --> 20:37.239
I saw a fruit knife on the table.

381
20:37.319 --> 20:38.959
You were resting your eyes at the time.

382
20:39.039 --> 20:41.079
Woken up by me, you looked at me for a moment.

383
20:56.559 --> 20:58.600
You thought I wanted fruit,

384
20:58.680 --> 21:00.279
so you casually handed me a mangosteen.

385
21:02.119 --> 21:03.839
I had a fever and tonsillitis.

386
21:04.559 --> 21:06.160
My throat hurt terribly,

387
21:06.240 --> 21:07.640
and I hadn't spoken in a long time.

388
21:08.559 --> 21:09.600
I originally thought

389
21:09.680 --> 21:11.400
I'd never make it out of Xiaolanshan alive.

390
21:11.599 --> 21:13.399
And even if I did, it'd just be another cage.

391
21:13.759 --> 21:15.039
But...

392
21:15.119 --> 21:16.119
But what?

393
21:18.279 --> 21:19.880
Back then, I thought to myself,

394
21:21.440 --> 21:23.440
I hadn't come over to ask your name yet.

395
21:25.839 --> 21:26.839
I wanted to say,

396
21:28.079 --> 21:29.079
"Thank you.

397
21:30.039 --> 21:31.599
May I ask what your name is?"

398
21:35.680 --> 21:36.759
My name is Zhao Shengge.

399
21:38.440 --> 21:39.799
Hello, Zhao Shengge.

400
21:40.440 --> 21:41.440
My name is Chen Wan.

401
21:46.519 --> 21:48.519
May I ask if you'd be with me?

402
21:48.599 --> 21:49.719
Do I not need to pursue you?

403
21:52.200 --> 21:53.200
Well,

404
21:55.200 --> 21:56.200
you still should.

405
21:58.920 --> 22:00.440
I take things pretty seriously.

406
22:01.039 --> 22:02.359
Pursuing someone is no different.

407
22:03.240 --> 22:04.999
You should have everything others have,

408
22:05.079 --> 22:07.000
and only even more than anyone else.

409
22:09.000 --> 22:10.960
Think it over carefully before you answer me.

410
22:12.240 --> 22:13.240
Zhao Shengge,

411
22:15.319 --> 22:17.000
may I ask why?

412
22:20.079 --> 22:21.079
Chen Wan,

413
22:24.000 --> 22:25.160
being drawn to you

414
22:25.680 --> 22:27.680
was a subtle yet inevitable process.

415
22:29.119 --> 22:30.119
Chen Wan,

416
22:30.839 --> 22:33.160
no one in this world could dislike you.

417
22:34.200 --> 22:37.000
Still, I don't like you just because you like me.

418
22:38.720 --> 22:40.759
You don't need to go looking for

419
22:41.319 --> 22:42.559
one specific reason.

420
22:45.119 --> 22:46.640
You yourself are the answer.

421
23:03.880 --> 23:05.160
Let's go.

422
23:05.240 --> 23:06.240
Let's head home.

423
23:26.480 --> 23:27.920
That time at the casino,

424
23:28.000 --> 23:29.279
did you notice me?

425
23:31.720 --> 23:32.720
I don't recall.

426
23:34.759 --> 23:37.240
A Rolls-Royce took my parking spot that day.

427
23:40.240 --> 23:42.279
It's about time you got a new car anyway.

428
23:42.359 --> 23:43.919
I'll take you to pick one out tomorrow.

429
23:52.000 --> 23:53.000
Why did we come here?

430
23:53.640 --> 23:55.696
We staked out the Zhao, Shen, and Tan places with no luck.

431
23:55.720 --> 23:56.960
Surely we can catch him here.

432
23:57.839 --> 23:58.600
Hey, look!

433
23:58.680 --> 23:59.600
That car!

434
23:59.680 --> 24:01.719
I've seen it in Minglong's underground garage.

435
24:01.799 --> 24:02.600
No way.

436
24:02.680 --> 24:04.015
I'll chase him to the ends of the earth to find him.

437
24:04.039 --> 24:05.159
Keep waiting.

438
24:07.519 --> 24:08.519
Come on in.

439
24:15.200 --> 24:16.200
They're brand new.

440
24:19.319 --> 24:20.319
I've got it.

441
24:32.680 --> 24:33.800
It's not a big place.

442
24:33.880 --> 24:34.759
Make yourself at home.

443
24:34.839 --> 24:36.039
Once I have money,

444
24:36.119 --> 24:37.200
I'll buy you a big house.

445
24:38.640 --> 24:39.640
Do you have money?

446
24:41.039 --> 24:42.039
I can earn it.

447
24:46.960 --> 24:47.840
Make yourself comfortable.

448
24:47.920 --> 24:48.920
I'll pour you some tea.

449
25:56.960 --> 25:57.960
I didn't steal it.

450
25:59.880 --> 26:00.880
After your exam,

451
26:00.960 --> 26:02.119
you threw it in the trash.

452
26:04.119 --> 26:05.240
I didn't call you a thief.

453
26:06.359 --> 26:07.359
What about this?

454
26:09.720 --> 26:10.759
Can you tell me about it?

455
26:10.839 --> 26:13.600
That's from your last local league match.

456
26:13.680 --> 26:15.679
Maybe you felt the main campus courts and gym

457
26:15.759 --> 26:16.799
had too many spectators,

458
26:17.640 --> 26:20.160
so you went over to the Shaw Building on the branch campus.

459
26:21.160 --> 26:22.519
Around that time,

460
26:22.599 --> 26:24.479
I happened to be studying in the Shaw Building.

461
26:25.079 --> 26:26.720
You went to watch me play every day?

462
26:28.279 --> 26:29.719
Still, I really just picked this up.

463
26:31.759 --> 26:33.120
I'd never steal your things.

464
26:33.200 --> 26:34.200
It's okay.

465
26:35.160 --> 26:37.920
Why didn't you think of returning the ball to me?

466
26:40.240 --> 26:40.599
Look.

467
26:41.119 --> 26:42.679
There's a dent in it.

468
26:42.759 --> 26:44.239
I figured you didn't want it anymore.

469
26:45.000 --> 26:46.920
I wasn't going to bother you

470
26:47.000 --> 26:48.240
over something you didn't want.

471
26:50.279 --> 26:51.279
Chen Wan,

472
26:52.319 --> 26:53.879
you're quite good at picking things up.

473
26:55.119 --> 26:57.519
Keep at it, and now you've picked me up and brought me home.

474
27:03.319 --> 27:04.880
You bought the cufflinks for me too?

475
27:08.720 --> 27:10.079
Last time we were on Bei Island,

476
27:11.000 --> 27:12.000
they caught my eye.

477
27:13.519 --> 27:15.279
You even fought me for them back then.

478
27:15.359 --> 27:17.079
Though I was buying them for you anyway.

479
27:18.039 --> 27:19.080
If you had wanted them,

480
27:19.160 --> 27:20.320
I would've let you have them.

481
27:22.119 --> 27:23.680
I thought they were for a friend.

482
27:29.880 --> 27:31.279
I don't have that many friends.

483
27:33.839 --> 27:34.879
What about the wool scarf?

484
27:37.039 --> 27:38.480
When we video chatted before,

485
27:39.240 --> 27:42.039
I saw your balcony was made of marble.

486
27:42.119 --> 27:43.519
I worried it might be too chilly,

487
27:44.400 --> 27:45.640
especially during typhoons,

488
27:46.960 --> 27:48.400
so I bought it for you.

489
27:49.200 --> 27:51.000
I really didn't want you getting sick.

490
27:53.920 --> 27:55.160
Why?

491
27:55.240 --> 27:56.920
Why buy so many things for me?

492
28:00.240 --> 28:01.640
I don't know why either.

493
28:02.880 --> 28:04.240
I just wanted to buy them for you.

494
28:08.319 --> 28:10.759
It felt like a solo

495
28:11.440 --> 28:12.480
treasure hunt.

496
28:18.799 --> 28:19.840
And this too.

497
28:19.920 --> 28:21.120
I spotted this watch last time

498
28:21.200 --> 28:22.799
when we bought the cufflinks together.

499
28:23.559 --> 28:25.440
You didn't seem very interested,

500
28:25.960 --> 28:27.360
so I went back on my own to buy it.

501
28:27.680 --> 28:29.680
Still, these are all just based on my own taste.

502
28:30.240 --> 28:31.599
It's fine if you don't like them.

503
28:32.200 --> 28:34.640
Whatever you want, I'll buy it for you.

504
28:36.599 --> 28:38.039
You'll buy whatever I want?

505
28:41.519 --> 28:42.720
And this bottle of cologne.

506
28:46.079 --> 28:47.359
Look at this cologne.

507
28:49.480 --> 28:50.400
Last time,

508
28:50.480 --> 28:51.480
after our video call,

509
28:52.079 --> 28:54.079
seeing your home decor reminded me of it.

510
29:00.039 --> 29:01.119
And this bottle of wine.

511
29:02.480 --> 29:04.720
I saw how much you enjoyed it at the reception,

512
29:05.519 --> 29:07.160
so I went and bought a bottle afterward.

513
29:08.759 --> 29:10.679
I don't know if you'd consider bidding on these.

514
29:11.240 --> 29:12.679
I'm not sure if you'll like them.

515
29:12.759 --> 29:13.759
I really don't know...

516
29:22.319 --> 29:23.319
Chen Wan,

517
29:24.720 --> 29:25.839
I love them.

518
29:27.799 --> 29:29.400
Then would you consider bidding on them?

519
29:31.559 --> 29:33.359
Not only am I bidding on them,

520
29:34.119 --> 29:35.216
I want you to put them on me,

521
29:35.240 --> 29:37.200
every single one of them.

522
30:14.279 --> 30:15.600
Zhao Shengge,

523
30:15.680 --> 30:16.680
your kindness

524
30:17.240 --> 30:18.240
is so sexy.

525
30:21.325 --> 30:22.525
You even bought me ear studs?

526
30:23.039 --> 30:24.279
Too bad my ears aren't pierced.

527
30:28.759 --> 30:29.320
Though,

528
30:29.400 --> 30:30.640
I can get them pierced for you.

529
30:31.079 --> 30:32.360
Don't.

530
30:32.440 --> 30:33.440
No way.

531
30:33.480 --> 30:34.199
It'll hurt.

532
30:34.279 --> 30:35.120
Chen Wan,

533
30:35.200 --> 30:36.775
what gives you the right to withhold my gifts?

534
30:36.799 --> 30:38.199
I almost never got to receive them.

535
30:39.000 --> 30:40.400
Zhao Shengge,

536
30:40.480 --> 30:42.600
from now on, I'll buy you lots and lots of things.

537
30:42.680 --> 30:44.079
Even better ones.

538
31:13.039 --> 31:15.560
Tech Moguls' Rising Star Secretly Meets Same-Sex Friend,

539
31:15.640 --> 31:17.719
Inseparable for Two Days and Three Nights.

540
31:17.799 --> 31:18.600
Lately,

541
31:18.680 --> 31:19.600
Reporters are still calling him a rising star?

542
31:19.680 --> 31:20.680
Seriously?

543
31:20.759 --> 31:22.120
Hear me out first.

544
31:22.200 --> 31:22.840
It says right here

545
31:22.920 --> 31:24.575
the same person was seen going home with him three days straight,

546
31:24.599 --> 31:26.440
side by side, holding hands!

547
31:27.839 --> 31:28.320
Mr. Tan!

548
31:28.400 --> 31:29.400
Mr. Tan!

549
31:38.240 --> 31:39.240
Zhao Shengge!

550
31:39.960 --> 31:41.040
What's the meaning of this?

551
31:43.279 --> 31:44.400
Hey!

552
31:44.480 --> 31:45.400
Zhao Shengge, if you want to fool around,

553
31:45.480 --> 31:47.095
there are plenty of people out there for you.

554
31:47.119 --> 31:48.479
Not Chen Wan, though.

555
31:48.559 --> 31:50.199
He's not some unwanted nobody.

556
31:50.279 --> 31:51.359
He's my buddy!

557
31:52.119 --> 31:53.119
Fool around?

558
31:54.000 --> 31:55.000
Fool around with what?

559
31:56.720 --> 31:57.840
Are the two of you together?

560
31:58.440 --> 31:59.440
Not yet.

561
32:00.279 --> 32:01.279
I'm pursuing him.

562
32:04.519 --> 32:05.759
You actually pursue people?

563
32:12.160 --> 32:14.680
So this is your attitude toward my love life?

564
32:15.759 --> 32:17.279
What attitude am I supposed to have?

565
32:17.359 --> 32:19.959
Do you think Chen Wan's easy to push around because he's gentle?

566
32:20.039 --> 32:21.039
Zhixuan, stop!

567
32:21.079 --> 32:22.079
He still has us!

568
32:22.119 --> 32:23.200
I don't think that.

569
32:24.920 --> 32:26.079
I'm serious about him.

570
32:28.720 --> 32:29.720
You'd better be.

571
32:45.920 --> 32:46.679
Zhixuan,

572
32:46.759 --> 32:47.759
hold on.

573
32:54.759 --> 32:56.120
Shengge,

574
32:56.200 --> 32:57.519
I'm already miserable enough.

575
32:57.599 --> 32:58.880
My family froze my cards

576
32:59.519 --> 33:00.959
and took my cars.

577
33:01.039 --> 33:01.479
I...

578
33:01.559 --> 33:03.079
I can only bum rides off them now.

579
33:04.519 --> 33:06.600
If your family gives you a hard time,

580
33:06.680 --> 33:07.720
let me know anytime.

581
33:10.279 --> 33:11.359
You don't blame me?

582
33:12.799 --> 33:14.640
He can burn the whole place down if he wants.

583
33:15.319 --> 33:16.720
I just want the right to know.

584
33:18.599 --> 33:19.599
Zhao...

585
33:20.720 --> 33:21.720
Shengge?

586
33:22.799 --> 33:23.679
Zhixuan.

587
33:23.759 --> 33:24.920
What are they talking about?

588
33:25.000 --> 33:27.680
Thank you for looking out for Chen Wan for me these past few years.

589
33:27.720 --> 33:28.920
Don't mention it.

590
33:29.640 --> 33:30.880
Still,

591
33:30.960 --> 33:32.000
don't let it happen again.

592
33:45.839 --> 33:46.560
Zhixuan,

593
33:46.640 --> 33:47.720
did Zhao Shengge scold you?

594
33:49.279 --> 33:50.120
No.

595
33:50.200 --> 33:51.200
Serves you right.

596
33:53.960 --> 33:55.079
He didn't scold me!

597
33:56.559 --> 33:57.360
Hey.

598
33:57.440 --> 33:59.120
The kid got scolded silly.

599
33:59.200 --> 33:59.959
Let go!

600
34:00.039 --> 34:01.239
Sit tight.

601
34:01.319 --> 34:02.359
Who are you calling silly?

602
34:03.279 --> 34:03.959
It's fine.

603
34:04.039 --> 34:05.359
Chen Wan's even sillier than you.

604
34:06.680 --> 34:09.119
Long-standing firm Rongxin's stock has surged repeatedly

605
34:09.199 --> 34:10.479
amid rumors of a takeover.

606
34:10.559 --> 34:12.199
In response, a Rongxin Group spokesperson

607
34:12.239 --> 34:13.559
at today's press conference

608
34:13.639 --> 34:15.199
made the following statement:

609
34:16.519 --> 34:17.920
Faced with this hostile takeover,

610
34:18.000 --> 34:19.495
we will not sit back and wait for our demise.

611
34:19.519 --> 34:20.519
We will initiate...

612
34:21.400 --> 34:23.376
The shares acquired from the minority shareholders

613
34:23.400 --> 34:24.400
have cleared.

614
34:25.039 --> 34:27.400
I now hold over half of Rongxin's shares.

615
34:29.079 --> 34:30.519
Today's shareholders' meeting

616
34:31.079 --> 34:32.079
is sure to go smoothly.

617
34:33.480 --> 34:34.480
This time,

618
34:35.280 --> 34:37.800
I'll send the Chen family to hell myself.

619
34:38.360 --> 34:42.000
I must be the one to drive this knife in.

620
34:42.559 --> 34:43.559
Up to you.

621
34:44.199 --> 34:45.736
Do whatever it takes, burn it all down if you want.

622
34:45.760 --> 34:46.760
Just let me know.

623
34:48.000 --> 34:49.000
Okay.

624
35:14.639 --> 35:15.400
Everyone,

625
35:15.480 --> 35:16.559
before the meeting begins,

626
35:16.639 --> 35:18.280
I have an announcement to make.

627
35:21.159 --> 35:22.599
Mr. Chen Wan's shareholding

628
35:22.679 --> 35:24.000
has reached 52%,

629
35:24.599 --> 35:27.400
making him the company's largest shareholder.

630
35:27.480 --> 35:28.976
In accordance with regulations, the board

631
35:29.000 --> 35:30.639
has initiated a personnel change plan

632
35:30.719 --> 35:33.400
and registered Mr. Chen Wan as a shareholder.

633
35:33.480 --> 35:36.480
This change does not restructure the board.

634
35:37.800 --> 35:39.360
The existing strategy committee

635
35:39.440 --> 35:42.079
and audit committee functions remain unaffected.

636
35:42.159 --> 35:44.000
Please welcome Mr. Chen Wan.

637
35:45.960 --> 35:48.119
Based on this change in equity ownership,

638
35:48.199 --> 35:49.199
Mr. Chen Bingxin

639
35:49.239 --> 35:51.280
has lost his veto power.

640
35:51.360 --> 35:52.360
From now on,

641
35:52.440 --> 35:54.760
any major company decisions

642
35:54.840 --> 35:56.039
will be decided by me

643
35:56.119 --> 35:57.400
and executed by the board.

644
35:59.159 --> 36:00.320
Rongxin

645
36:00.400 --> 36:02.079
was founded single-handedly by me!

646
36:02.159 --> 36:03.999
No one knows it better than me,

647
36:04.079 --> 36:05.440
or has more say than me!

648
36:06.599 --> 36:08.079
Using cheap tricks,

649
36:08.159 --> 36:09.760
lying and cheating!

650
36:09.840 --> 36:11.079
You don't know a thing!

651
36:12.440 --> 36:13.840
Who are you to boss us around?

652
36:14.480 --> 36:16.479
Even a founder must obey the law.

653
36:16.559 --> 36:18.840
Decisions that violate corporate law are invalid.

654
36:18.920 --> 36:20.240
I hope Chairman Chen understands

655
36:20.320 --> 36:21.320
times have changed.

656
36:21.920 --> 36:23.039
From now on,

657
36:23.119 --> 36:25.800
the board will no longer be your one-man show.

658
36:27.480 --> 36:28.480
Mutiny!

659
36:37.039 --> 36:37.559
Wake up!

660
36:37.639 --> 36:40.479
Chen's 30-Year Empire Sinks in Central Harbor.

661
36:40.559 --> 36:43.480
Rongxin Falls to Taiji and Gets Carved Up.

662
36:44.039 --> 36:46.200
Haishi's long-standing Rongxin Group

663
36:46.280 --> 36:48.559
witnessed a dramatic change of control.

664
36:48.639 --> 36:49.240
We're here.

665
36:49.320 --> 36:50.416
Previously absent from many public gatherings,

666
36:50.440 --> 36:51.880
Chen Bingxin's fourth son, Chen Wan,

667
36:51.960 --> 36:53.439
has become the new head of Rongxin.

668
36:53.519 --> 36:54.439
Are you holding up okay?

669
36:54.519 --> 36:56.079
Meanwhile, founder Chen Bingxin

670
36:56.159 --> 36:56.680
I'm fine.

671
36:56.760 --> 36:58.456
and several directors, over suspected equity irregularities...

672
36:58.480 --> 37:00.599
Rongxin is completely fractured right now.

673
37:00.679 --> 37:02.280
I have to wipe them out completely,

674
37:02.360 --> 37:03.920
or there will be endless trouble later.

675
37:04.920 --> 37:05.920
Alright.

676
37:10.400 --> 37:11.400
It suits you well.

677
37:14.519 --> 37:16.880
As for Ge Xi pushing for the share transfer,

678
37:16.960 --> 37:18.599
it's fine to take your time.

679
37:19.440 --> 37:20.559
Doing it in stages is best.

680
37:21.400 --> 37:22.920
If circumstances allow,

681
37:23.000 --> 37:25.039
your mom could also step in where appropriate.

682
37:25.960 --> 37:26.360
Of course,

683
37:26.440 --> 37:28.200
that's just a suggestion.

684
37:28.280 --> 37:29.280
You decide.

685
37:36.320 --> 37:37.400
Don't drop me off tomorrow.

686
37:38.079 --> 37:39.079
Get some extra sleep.

687
37:40.199 --> 37:41.679
That's no way to pursue someone.

688
37:43.719 --> 37:45.039
Then stop pursuing me

689
37:45.119 --> 37:46.119
and make it official.

690
37:46.880 --> 37:47.880
No.

691
37:47.920 --> 37:48.920
I haven't passed yet.

692
37:50.440 --> 37:51.440
What more does it take?

693
37:55.559 --> 37:56.960
I haven't done well enough.

694
37:58.559 --> 38:00.039
How is it not good enough?

695
38:00.119 --> 38:01.119
Zhao Shengge,

696
38:02.559 --> 38:05.439
you've barely left my side lately.

697
38:05.519 --> 38:06.959
You couldn't possibly be any better.

698
38:07.519 --> 38:08.519
Chen Wan,

699
38:09.239 --> 38:10.840
are you comparing me to other people?

700
38:11.639 --> 38:12.639
What do you mean?

701
38:13.599 --> 38:14.999
If you're going to compare me,

702
38:15.079 --> 38:16.639
compare me to yourself.

703
38:16.719 --> 38:17.960
You set the standard.

704
38:18.880 --> 38:20.639
Because my standard is Chen Wan,

705
38:21.360 --> 38:22.880
I'm always one step behind.

706
38:25.320 --> 38:26.479
In that case,

707
38:26.559 --> 38:28.720
whether you've won me over is up to you?

708
38:28.800 --> 38:30.439
It's up to you.

709
38:30.519 --> 38:31.840
However,

710
38:31.920 --> 38:33.320
going easy on me wouldn't be right.

711
38:37.719 --> 38:39.000
It's almost time.

712
38:47.440 --> 38:48.800
Zhao Shengge,

713
38:48.880 --> 38:49.920
I won't go easy on you.

714
38:50.440 --> 38:51.880
Even though it's not official yet,

715
38:52.880 --> 38:55.239
surely a kiss first is allowed, right?

716
38:57.760 --> 38:58.760
It is.

717
39:20.079 --> 39:20.559
Hey, hey!

718
39:20.639 --> 39:22.079
Hold on, let me see.

719
39:23.480 --> 39:24.896
Didn't you fail to get a front shot too?

720
39:24.920 --> 39:26.000
Yeah.

721
39:27.800 --> 39:29.215
Forget it, maybe it's better we didn't.

722
39:29.239 --> 39:30.240
What if we published it

723
39:30.320 --> 39:31.959
and someone like Zhao Shengge caught us?

724
39:32.039 --> 39:34.519
Wouldn't we end up just like Mak Ka Fai?

725
39:35.719 --> 39:36.719
Gentlemen,

726
39:37.360 --> 39:38.479
have some water.

727
39:38.559 --> 39:39.800
No, no, we're good.

728
39:40.679 --> 39:42.639
Compliments of our young master.

729
39:42.719 --> 39:43.719
Okay, thank you.

730
39:44.440 --> 39:45.680
By the way,

731
39:45.760 --> 39:47.200
did you get any good shots?

732
39:47.280 --> 39:48.519
Man, we didn't get anything.

733
39:56.159 --> 39:57.679
That makes things tricky.

734
40:06.760 --> 40:07.760
Hello, Special Assistant?

735
40:08.559 --> 40:09.879
They didn't get any shots at all.

736
40:10.440 --> 40:11.519
That's going to be tough.

737
40:11.599 --> 40:13.079
Mr. Zhao specifically asked for this.

738
40:13.880 --> 40:16.559
Then get a few more media outlets on it.

739
40:16.639 --> 40:17.639
Got it.

740
40:19.360 --> 40:21.159
That meeting totally wiped me out.

741
40:22.639 --> 40:23.639
Shen Zongnian,

742
40:23.719 --> 40:24.719
I want a feast.

743
40:25.239 --> 40:26.816
There's a pretty good Thai place lately.

744
40:26.840 --> 40:27.680
Want to try it?

745
40:27.760 --> 40:28.119
Sure,

746
40:28.679 --> 40:29.679
let's go there.

747
40:29.739 --> 40:30.826
[I'm almost done over here]

748
40:31.219 --> 40:32.339
[Same here]

749
40:32.800 --> 40:33.720
Zhao Shengge,

750
40:33.800 --> 40:34.800
are you coming?

751
40:35.179 --> 40:36.359
[I'm finished]

752
40:37.559 --> 40:38.959
Hello?

753
40:39.039 --> 40:40.439
Are you done?

754
40:40.519 --> 40:41.816
Looks like it's going to rain outside.

755
40:41.840 --> 40:43.119
Don't come pick me up.

756
40:43.199 --> 40:44.319
I'll just take a cab to you.

757
40:44.360 --> 40:45.240
No need.

758
40:45.320 --> 40:46.320
Wait for me.

759
40:48.679 --> 40:49.800
I'm not going.

760
40:49.880 --> 40:51.080
I have to go pick up Chen Wan.

761
40:52.159 --> 40:54.240
If the rain gets in your way,

762
40:54.320 --> 40:55.800
you can order in and eat at Minglong.

763
40:57.280 --> 40:58.400
Zhao Shengge,

764
40:58.480 --> 40:59.560
it's about to rain outside.

765
40:59.639 --> 41:01.119
Just send your driver to pick him up.

766
41:02.679 --> 41:04.159
My driver isn't the one pursuing him.

767
41:08.199 --> 41:08.800
Let's go.

768
41:08.880 --> 41:09.880
Just the two of us.

769
41:23.719 --> 41:25.800
The 0659 model chip has been discontinued.

770
41:26.440 --> 41:28.360
Then build one that supports continuous updates.

771
41:43.986 --> 41:45.041
Everything over at Xiaolanshan

772
41:45.079 --> 41:46.439
has been arranged.

773
41:46.519 --> 41:47.240
Good.

774
41:47.320 --> 41:48.320
Got it.

775
41:48.960 --> 41:49.960
Thanks.
